    "detailed_description": "<strong>Embark on an epic space journey with &quot;Hera,&quot; a thrilling game where you confront robots and aid survivors. Step into the shoes of Ayce, a determined character with a mysterious past, on a quest to fulfill her dream of exploring space.<br><br>In this desolate world, you'll battle relentless robots, scavenging for anything you can find. But it's not just about fighting\u2014meet survivors, make choices, and unravel the secrets of Ayce's story.<br><br>The game seamlessly combines exciting action with a captivating storyline, providing an immersive experience for anyone eager to join Ayce on her cosmic adventure. Are you ready to become the space explorer you've always dreamed of? The stars await!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Embark on an epic space journey with &quot;Hera,&quot; a thrilling game where you confront robots and aid survivors. Step into the shoes of Ayce, a determined character with a mysterious past, on a quest to fulfill her dream of exploring space.<br><br>In this desolate world, you'll battle relentless robots, scavenging for anything you can find. But it's not just about fighting\u2014meet survivors, make choices, and unravel the secrets of Ayce's story.<br><br>The game seamlessly combines exciting action with a captivating storyline, providing an immersive experience for anyone eager to join Ayce on her cosmic adventure. Are you ready to become the space explorer you've always dreamed of? The stars await!</strong>",
